  "comment": "Reviewed redistribution policy. A component is mirrored only when an 'include' rule matches its group and module name, or 'by_pom' accepts the license its own POM declares, and no 'exclude' rule matches. Anything else is not mirrored. Changing this file is a license decision: cite the upstream's own license file in 'evidence'.",
